<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Default locale: Spanish. English lives in values-en/.

    Conventions:
      * uci_a11y_*  -> content descriptions and state descriptions. Never shown
                       on screen; written as a sentence a screen reader can read
                       out loud, ending without a full stop.
      * Plurals are real <plurals>, not "%d elemento(s)".
      * No string is concatenated in code. Anything with a variable part is a
        format string, because word order changes between languages.
-->
